      "notes": "<p>Columns from ### headings. Two to six of them on one slide make one column each.</p>",
      "options": {},
      "steps": 0,
      "title": "Two themes and a switch",
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "data-count": "2",
      },
      "hash": "cde870ec92",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>Columns, two ways</h2></header><div class="s-cols"><section class="s-col"><p>Start each column with a ### heading, as on the last slide. Two to six of them make columns.</p></section><section class="s-col"><p>Or put a line of three pipes between blocks of text. Each block becomes a column.</p></section></div></div>",
