      "hash": "42a7b03baa",
      "html": "<div class="s-main"><header class="s-head"><h2>A picture behind the words</h2></header><div class="s-body"><p>A bg comment puts an image behind the slide, under a dark scrim, and switches the slide to Ink. It takes a CSS colour too.</p></div></div>",
      "id": "a-picture-behind-the-words",
